OL,3,AVapes could lead to health harms in
OL,4,Achildren, doctors warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FVaping could lead to health harms in
OL,7,Fchildren and young people and should be
OL,8,Fmade "less attractive" to them, doctors
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe Royal College of Paediatrics and
OL,12,FChild Health (RCPCH) has reviewed about
OL,13,F81 studies into vaping and said it is
OL,14,Flinked to higher rates of breathing
OL,15,Fproblems and  evidence of harm in
OL,16,Fbabies whose mothers used vapes while
OL,17,Fpregnant.
OL,19,FThe review said vaping should not be
OL,20,Fseen as a "harmless part of growing
OL,21,Fup".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
